WEBVTT

00:02.280 --> 00:05.480
Leafe, it is the source of life.

00:06.320 --> 00:10.790
Leafe, it is a power all living things have,

00:10.790 --> 00:12.880
...even men, even women.

00:13.690 --> 00:17.720
When the Leafe of the Prétear and the Leafe of a Knight become one,

00:18.630 --> 00:21.790
...a new power is born.

00:43.090 --> 00:44.290
Hayate!

00:44.290 --> 00:45.480
Is that you, Sasame?

00:46.830 --> 00:48.880
That sinister presence just now, could it be...

00:49.590 --> 00:50.720
It seems...

00:52.200 --> 00:54.800
...what we feared has come to pass.

00:54.800 --> 00:55.670
Kei...

00:55.670 --> 00:57.230
Let's get everyone.

00:57.770 --> 01:01.330
Spring of Leafe, summon your guardians.

01:03.180 --> 01:03.830
Mannen...

01:04.840 --> 01:05.430
Go...

01:06.380 --> 01:07.070
Hajime...

01:07.680 --> 01:08.300
Shin...

01:09.310 --> 01:10.040
There.

01:11.120 --> 01:12.880
So the seal's been broken?

01:18.220 --> 01:19.190
What are those?

01:19.190 --> 01:20.630
Seeds of disaster.

01:20.630 --> 01:24.530
The Princess of Disaster is calling for the red snow of disaster to fall on Earth.

01:24.530 --> 01:28.170
We can't allow the resurrection of Fenrir, the Princess of Disaster.

01:28.170 --> 01:31.430
We have to find her soon, the one who will turn the snow white.

01:31.970 --> 01:35.240
The boundless future stretches across the skies

01:31.970 --> 01:35.240
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:35.240 --> 01:39.280
And I am reborn anew

01:35.240 --> 01:39.280
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

01:39.280 --> 01:46.300
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

01:39.280 --> 01:46.300
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

01:50.260 --> 01:50.460
Prétear

01:58.530 --> 02:05.440
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

01:58.530 --> 02:05.440
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

02:05.440 --> 02:10.230
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

02:05.440 --> 02:10.230
kimerareta ashita wa nai

02:12.280 --> 02:19.180
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

02:12.280 --> 02:19.180
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

02:19.180 --> 02:24.090
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

02:19.180 --> 02:24.090
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

02:25.920 --> 02:29.790
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

02:25.920 --> 02:29.790
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

02:29.790 --> 02:32.930
If the cold wind glimmers

02:29.790 --> 02:32.930
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

02:32.930 --> 02:38.700
I can hear your voice drifting gently

02:32.930 --> 02:38.700
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

02:38.870 --> 02:39.170
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

02:38.870 --> 02:43.640
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

02:43.640 --> 02:46.180
Warms it so much that it hurts

02:43.640 --> 02:46.180
kono mune o atsuku suru

02:46.180 --> 02:48.910
It all begins from the point of believing

02:46.180 --> 02:48.910
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

02:48.910 --> 02:52.580
These feelings are proof of being alive

02:48.910 --> 02:52.580
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

02:52.580 --> 02:52.880
The endless future and the expanding skies

02:52.580 --> 02:55.790
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

02:55.790 --> 02:59.820
Allow me to be reborn anew

02:55.790 --> 02:59.820
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:59.820 --> 03:05.930
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:59.820 --> 03:05.930
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

03:05.930 --> 03:10.530
Holding hands with you

03:05.930 --> 03:12.530
sono te tsunaide

03:12.600 --> 03:15.970
Winds of Destiny

03:20.080 --> 03:22.240
This is packed with nutrition!

03:23.780 --> 03:26.480
Grow up to be strong!

03:26.480 --> 03:27.580
Miss!

03:28.420 --> 03:30.490
Your meal has been prepared.

03:30.490 --> 03:31.750
All right!

03:32.390 --> 03:36.730
I'm Himeno Awayuki. I've recently entered high school.

03:36.730 --> 03:43.630
My father remarried last month, so now I'm living in this house, but mansion would be a better word!

03:44.670 --> 03:45.730
Miss...

03:46.570 --> 03:49.140
Mikage, please don't call me Miss. Call me Himeno.

03:49.140 --> 03:50.280
But...

03:50.280 --> 03:53.140
Oh, don't mind it at all. I'm not into formalities like that.

03:53.140 --> 03:56.480
Until recently, I was just the daughter of a washed-up novelist.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.440
Hey!

03:58.980 --> 04:01.090
What are you doing at this hour?

04:01.090 --> 04:07.180
I'm balancing our minimal budget AND I'm making these meals thinking about nutritional balance, so eat your food!

04:08.630 --> 04:09.250
My food!

04:13.530 --> 04:15.370
I was living that kind of life.

04:15.370 --> 04:21.200
At any rate, since this is what's happened, I'd better get used to this environment as soon I can!

04:23.480 --> 04:27.040
Good mor...ning...

04:27.780 --> 04:30.480
My stepsisters, Mayune and Mawata.

04:31.620 --> 04:33.320
Natsue, my new mother.

04:33.320 --> 04:34.790
Good morning, Himeno!

04:34.790 --> 04:36.590
You're late.

04:36.590 --> 04:38.180
We've started without you.

04:39.090 --> 04:40.850
I'm sorry, Mother.

04:41.390 --> 04:44.730
Now, to get along with my new family and enjoy a fun family life...

04:45.230 --> 04:46.390
Himeno!
Miss Himeno!

04:47.030 --> 04:48.590
Damn it, that hurt!

04:50.170 --> 04:52.830
Someone cut the legs of the chair.

04:53.340 --> 04:55.470
Are you okay, Himeno?

04:55.470 --> 04:56.780
Miss Himeno?

04:56.780 --> 04:58.480
Yes, I'm all right, Mother.

04:58.480 --> 04:59.340
"That hurt."

04:59.980 --> 05:02.540
"Damn it, that hurt?" Watch your language. How uncouth.

05:03.080 --> 05:05.240
I'm sorry. That hurt.

05:05.820 --> 05:08.320
Don't mind that, Mother.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.590
Mayune!

05:09.590 --> 05:13.190
Her upbringing was so different that she doesn't even know how to sit in a chair properly.

05:13.190 --> 05:14.680
Right, Himeno?

05:16.530 --> 05:18.430
So this is your doing, you bitch!

05:19.130 --> 05:21.720
There's no need to thank me!

05:23.640 --> 05:25.100
They get along so well.

05:26.140 --> 05:27.270
I'm done.

05:27.270 --> 05:29.400
Done already, Mawata?

05:32.240 --> 05:34.710
I'm done as well. Thank you.

05:34.710 --> 05:35.680
Tanaka? The car?

05:35.680 --> 05:37.740
Yes, it is ready for you.

05:38.280 --> 05:42.020
Then let us go as well, Kaoru.

05:42.020 --> 05:44.390
Oh, yeah.

05:45.190 --> 05:46.520
Himeno, take your time.

05:46.520 --> 05:48.490
Hey, Dad!

05:54.830 --> 05:56.070
Miss Himeno...

05:56.070 --> 05:57.070
Thanks.

05:57.070 --> 05:57.900
And...

06:00.340 --> 06:01.400
I'm also going!

06:08.980 --> 06:10.570
They left.

06:14.090 --> 06:15.350
Mom...

06:17.420 --> 06:18.580
I...

06:24.860 --> 06:26.830
This is no time to be depressed!

06:29.570 --> 06:37.200
I won't let them beat me!

06:30.970 --> 06:34.370
Sinister Path House Style Karate,
Martial Arts Dance, Type One

06:36.110 --> 06:36.880
Natsue Kaoru

06:39.840 --> 06:46.820
Awayuki Foods

06:39.840 --> 06:46.820
Awayuki Third District

06:39.840 --> 06:44.050
All of this city's businesses were affiliated with the Hojo Conglomorate,

06:44.050 --> 06:45.880
...and it was called Hojo City.

06:45.880 --> 06:51.460
But when the widowed Natsue Hojo married my father,

06:46.820 --> 06:53.790
Awayuki
Station

06:51.460 --> 06:53.790
...she changed it to Awayuki Town!

06:53.790 --> 06:55.890
Awayuki
Bank

06:53.790 --> 06:57.030
Even all the related businesses and store names were changed.

06:57.030 --> 07:00.230
Rich people really do unbelievable things.

07:01.570 --> 07:03.370
Geez! I may not make it.

07:03.370 --> 07:04.430
All right!

07:04.970 --> 07:06.330
It's time for a short cut!

07:10.940 --> 07:13.140
Red snow?

07:17.220 --> 07:19.080
That's awesome, Mannen!

07:19.080 --> 07:22.290
See? My hunches are just awesome!

07:22.290 --> 07:24.480
Isn't it disgusting, Tipi?

07:25.990 --> 07:27.190
All right, stand back!

07:27.190 --> 07:28.960
Mannen? Where's the demon larva?

07:31.530 --> 07:34.170
Good, it hasn't rooted yet.

07:34.170 --> 07:38.030
Hey! I found it so it's my prey!

07:41.070 --> 07:41.900
Out of the way!

07:53.020 --> 07:53.590
Hayate!

07:53.590 --> 07:54.820
The demon larva?

07:54.820 --> 07:56.490
I just put it to sleep.

07:56.490 --> 07:57.890
You're so high and mighty...

07:57.890 --> 07:59.250
Shin, seal it.

08:00.290 --> 08:01.350
<i>Les sheles!</i>

08:16.840 --> 08:18.240
Good thing we made it in time.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.880
Are you all right, Hayate?

08:19.880 --> 08:21.000
No need to worry.

08:21.780 --> 08:24.780
But I don't think this could be the only one.

08:24.780 --> 08:28.120
We'd better assume demon larvae are spread all over the city.

08:28.120 --> 08:28.920
Probably.

08:28.920 --> 08:31.920
Looks like we'll need the Prétear's powers after all.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.860
No, we don't need the Prétear.

08:33.860 --> 08:36.060
What are you saying, Hayate?

08:36.060 --> 08:40.160
If a demon larva takes root, we can't do much with our powers.

08:40.160 --> 08:41.970
We don't need her!

08:41.970 --> 08:43.400
Hayate...

08:45.270 --> 08:47.640
We won't be able to get by like this forever!

08:47.640 --> 08:51.180
The power of Shin's seal isn't infinite.

08:51.180 --> 08:52.080
I'm going.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.080
Hey, wait!

08:53.080 --> 08:54.810
We're coming too!

08:54.810 --> 08:56.070
Hayate...

09:01.420 --> 09:04.480
Are we going to let the same thing happen all over again?

09:09.430 --> 09:10.900
What's the matter, little boy?

09:10.900 --> 09:11.900
How cute!

09:11.900 --> 09:13.500
He's like a doll!

09:13.500 --> 09:14.490
What's your name?

09:17.070 --> 09:19.900
Just as I thought, they took the bait!

09:20.640 --> 09:22.340
Gotta hand it to you, Mannen!

09:22.340 --> 09:25.810
With that many of them, at least one's got to have a reaction to Shin's hands!

09:25.810 --> 09:27.370
And that'll be the Prétear, right?

09:27.780 --> 09:29.710
This boy's hair is so soft!

09:29.710 --> 09:30.680
Let's see, let's see.

09:31.480 --> 09:33.780
His cheeks are like marshmallows!

09:35.590 --> 09:37.250
Hey, stupid, don't come this way!

09:37.790 --> 09:40.090
Why are you running away?

09:40.090 --> 09:41.350
<i>Wait!</i>

09:44.630 --> 09:47.070
Hey, wait! Why are you all running away?

09:47.070 --> 09:48.790
I just want to hold your hands! Hey!

09:50.070 --> 09:51.730
<i>Get away from me, you pervert!</i>

09:52.470 --> 09:53.940
What the hell?

09:53.940 --> 09:55.000
It's just holding hands...

10:07.590 --> 10:08.750
Here too?

10:12.020 --> 10:12.960
A demon larva?!

10:24.370 --> 10:25.390
Out of the way!

10:27.270 --> 10:28.700
That hurt!

10:29.840 --> 10:31.210
I'm sor...

10:33.980 --> 10:36.380
He's really good looking.

10:36.980 --> 10:38.450
Could this possibly be...

10:41.590 --> 10:42.350
You...

10:43.390 --> 10:44.050
...are...

10:45.090 --> 10:45.890
...heavy!

10:45.890 --> 10:49.090
Damn it, there are limits even to the lack of common sense!

10:49.090 --> 10:52.830
You jump out all of a sudden and then put all your weight on me!

10:52.830 --> 10:55.530
Damn, you were heavy. I thought I was going to die!

10:57.270 --> 11:03.070
Hey! You toss and roll aside a weak young maiden without a "Are you all right, Miss?" or anything proper like that?!

11:03.070 --> 11:05.610
What? That's my line!

11:05.610 --> 11:08.010
It's not fun to get killed just because I was walking by!

11:08.010 --> 11:08.680
What?!

11:08.680 --> 11:09.650
You heavy girl!

11:13.580 --> 11:17.120
Anyway, why are you sticking your face in here?!

11:17.120 --> 11:18.720
This is the Haruta residence!

11:18.720 --> 11:20.430
I know. You were peeping!

11:20.430 --> 11:22.190
How disgusting, you're a Peeping Tom!

11:22.190 --> 11:24.960
So the target is the young wife, Mrs. Haruta!

11:24.960 --> 11:26.260
I know nothing about that!

11:26.260 --> 11:29.230
Not to mention, why the hell did you jump out from there?!

11:29.230 --> 11:30.130
Don't change the subject!

11:30.130 --> 11:31.470
You're the one changing subjects...

11:31.470 --> 11:33.470
Mrs. Haruta! You're being spied on!

11:33.470 --> 11:34.240
Why you!

11:34.240 --> 11:36.000
No! A pervert!

11:38.680 --> 11:41.740
Ow! Why is my body so prone to static shock?

11:43.920 --> 11:47.080
Oh, no! This is no time to be fooling around like this!

11:47.080 --> 11:49.850
You're lucky! Now get out of my way!

11:51.390 --> 11:52.580
That was...

11:54.330 --> 11:55.620
It can't be.

11:56.760 --> 11:57.860
She's...

11:57.860 --> 11:59.990
What's with that guy, anyway?!

12:00.530 --> 12:02.730
His face is the only thing good about him!

12:02.730 --> 12:04.500
Inside, he's rotten to the core!

12:06.170 --> 12:08.230
This sucks!

12:11.680 --> 12:13.010
Thank you, Go.

12:14.310 --> 12:16.370
So far, it seems no one's hit the jackpot.

12:18.820 --> 12:22.980
Hey, is she really in this city? You'd better not be lying.

12:23.920 --> 12:26.720
Damn, that hurt! Why you!

12:26.720 --> 12:28.490
Children are so innocent.

12:31.430 --> 12:32.400
Hayate?

12:36.370 --> 12:38.040
What are you doing there?

12:38.040 --> 12:40.170
What's the matter? You don't look pleased.

12:40.170 --> 12:41.370
Oh, it's nothing.

12:41.370 --> 12:43.770
At any rate, hurry and get some food for yourself.

12:43.770 --> 12:45.240
After eating, we'll go search some more.

12:46.080 --> 12:47.780
Hey, what're you doing, Go?!

12:47.780 --> 12:49.770
I'm telling you to hurry up and eat!

12:50.780 --> 12:52.380
I'm done!

12:52.380 --> 12:55.290
Hey, what kind of a person is the Prétear?

12:55.290 --> 13:00.180
Yeah! Just because she reacts to our powers doesn't mean she's easy to find!

13:01.390 --> 13:02.890
Hayate!

13:02.890 --> 13:04.520
You found her, didn't you?

13:15.770 --> 13:19.140
Yayoi! Can you go shopping with me on the way back?

13:19.140 --> 13:20.780
Oh, sure. Where, where?

13:20.780 --> 13:21.940
Miss Takato!

13:23.780 --> 13:25.220
I wonder what it is?

13:25.220 --> 13:27.080
Sorry, just a bit, Himeno?

13:28.120 --> 13:31.690
Miss Takato, you'd better not go near her.

13:31.690 --> 13:33.020
Everyone will think you're with her.

13:33.560 --> 13:37.560
She's Himeno Awayuki. You know what she's all about, don't you?

13:37.560 --> 13:43.330
She's the daughter of a drunkard novelist who married Miss Mayune's mother for her money!

13:43.330 --> 13:47.540
She's probably got a cocky attitude now that the school's been named after her family name.

13:47.540 --> 13:49.370
It's just giving us unwanted hassles.

13:49.370 --> 13:53.830
Poor Miss Mayune, to be called family with people like that.

13:55.110 --> 13:58.220
Her feelings must be gravely hurt.

13:58.220 --> 13:59.550
Hey, Himeno!

14:03.020 --> 14:04.180
Himeno...

14:07.490 --> 14:09.930
What gives? As if though they know anything.

14:09.930 --> 14:11.800
After the money, my ass.

14:11.800 --> 14:15.430
Dad and Natsue are madly in love with each other and we'll definitely become a family.

14:16.370 --> 14:17.600
It's Mawata.

14:18.540 --> 14:20.370
So she's not being driven home.

14:20.370 --> 14:23.340
Mawata! Let's go home toge...

14:25.080 --> 14:26.110
What?

14:26.110 --> 14:28.410
Hey, she's Mawata's...

14:28.410 --> 14:29.780
She's been ignored.

14:29.780 --> 14:32.380
She's not in Mawata's league.

14:32.380 --> 14:34.580
There's no way they can become sisters.

14:43.830 --> 14:45.420
I'm home.

14:46.330 --> 14:47.890
Like anyone's going to hear.

14:48.430 --> 14:50.430
I can't believe this life.

14:50.430 --> 14:54.000
I'm living in a castle-like home and I have a new family,

14:54.540 --> 14:56.230
...but why is it...

14:57.440 --> 15:00.070
...that it isn't warm or loving at all?

15:01.280 --> 15:05.480
I'm sure no one's noticed that I'm home.

15:05.480 --> 15:07.780
Why am I here?

15:08.520 --> 15:11.850
This is my home but there are a lot of things I don't know about.

15:14.260 --> 15:16.060
A pond in the middle of the yard?

15:17.060 --> 15:18.930
Talk about having money.

15:27.870 --> 15:29.530
I wonder if it's impossible after all?

15:30.880 --> 15:32.040
Hey, again?

15:32.710 --> 15:33.770
It disappeared.

15:34.480 --> 15:37.010
I wonder what would happen if I disappeared?

15:37.010 --> 15:38.780
If I vanish now...

15:40.480 --> 15:44.750
Geez! No, no! I'm the worst for thinking like that!

15:47.730 --> 15:49.690
My bad luck powers are strong.

15:50.630 --> 15:53.530
It's easier to be freed from misery by giving up.

15:54.470 --> 15:55.670
But...

15:55.670 --> 15:56.630
Are you all right?

15:56.630 --> 15:57.500
Yes...

15:58.470 --> 15:59.490
Well...

16:02.270 --> 16:02.930
Yes!

16:03.570 --> 16:05.040
I see. That's good.

16:10.780 --> 16:11.480
Yo!

16:11.480 --> 16:12.580
Pleased to meet you.

16:12.580 --> 16:14.620
Pleased to meet... That is...

16:14.620 --> 16:17.090
Well, who are you people?

16:18.420 --> 16:20.120
Leafe Knights!

16:20.120 --> 16:21.060
Ta-da!

16:21.890 --> 16:23.830
Idiots, this isn't a game.

16:27.970 --> 16:29.630
What was that for?!

16:30.170 --> 16:31.170
I understand what your game is.

16:31.170 --> 16:33.640
You brought your good-looking friends to do me in, right?

16:34.470 --> 16:36.640
Pleased to meet you, Miss Himeno Awayuki.

16:36.640 --> 16:38.580
No, I should say, Prétear, Princess of Light.

16:38.580 --> 16:40.600
Pré-what?

16:41.380 --> 16:42.510
Leafe?

16:42.510 --> 16:47.380
Right, on this planet, all livings things have Leafe living in them.

16:47.380 --> 16:48.790
I see...

16:48.790 --> 16:50.390
You've seen the red snow, haven't you?

16:50.390 --> 16:52.190
Well, yeah.

16:52.190 --> 16:58.090
A sinister being called Fenrir is after the Leafe to heighten her own power.

16:58.460 --> 17:00.230
A sinister being?

17:00.230 --> 17:03.370
If the Leafe disappears, the world will be destroyed!

17:03.370 --> 17:05.770
That would be horrible.

17:05.770 --> 17:07.740
At any rate, I need to be going now...

17:08.370 --> 17:09.840
We need you,

17:11.280 --> 17:12.330
...Himeno.

17:13.380 --> 17:14.880
Need me for what?

17:14.880 --> 17:18.280
There is a limit to our powers as Leafe Knights.

17:18.280 --> 17:22.580
But with you, we can save the world from Fenrir, the Princess of Disaster.

17:23.490 --> 17:24.650
Me?

17:25.390 --> 17:27.480
You're the only one who can do it.

17:37.370 --> 17:38.530
Himeno!

17:39.670 --> 17:44.730
I liked that "We need you" part, but I hate this kind of rubbish.

17:45.880 --> 17:47.980
You plan on tricking me, right?

17:47.980 --> 17:52.180
You're planning to make me feel all good, and when I finally believe, you'll drop and laugh at me, right?

17:52.180 --> 17:54.890
I'm sorry, but I'm not that stupid!

17:54.890 --> 17:55.990
Himeno, that's not...

17:55.990 --> 17:56.950
Leave her be.

17:57.490 --> 17:59.620
She can't become the Prétear.

17:59.620 --> 18:03.330
Even if she has the power, with that twisted personality...

18:03.330 --> 18:05.120
Well, excuse me for having such a twisted personality!

18:05.530 --> 18:07.360
Hey, everyone! Something's not right!

18:07.360 --> 18:10.530
The water's Leafe is getting weaker and weaker.

18:12.040 --> 18:13.370
Damn, in the water?!

18:13.370 --> 18:14.930
Hajime, Shin, get back!

18:17.580 --> 18:18.780
What's that?

18:18.780 --> 18:20.800
A demon larva has reached maturity!

18:21.280 --> 18:22.780
Demon larva?

18:22.780 --> 18:26.780
A demon larva is a servant of darkness unleashed by Fenrir, the Princess of Disaster.

18:26.780 --> 18:33.880
It absorbs Leafe as it grows, then offers it to Fenrir in order to amplify her sinister powers!

18:35.860 --> 18:38.120
The tree, the tree's withering away!

18:45.870 --> 18:48.000
Hey! What are you doing?

18:48.770 --> 18:49.940
Hey! Hey!

18:49.940 --> 18:52.530
It's dangerous! We have to get everyone out of here!

18:53.480 --> 18:54.980
We can't.

18:54.980 --> 18:59.380
We're Leafe Knights. We have to protect this world's Leafe.

18:59.380 --> 19:00.980
We won't run!

19:01.620 --> 19:04.590
Hey, Lady, please become the Prétear.

19:04.590 --> 19:07.790
Yeah! Fight with us!

19:08.530 --> 19:09.290
Stop it.

19:09.290 --> 19:10.290
But!

19:10.290 --> 19:13.420
Get out of here! We don't need you!

19:17.530 --> 19:18.470
Himeno!

19:18.470 --> 19:20.170
Hayate, what have you done?!

19:20.170 --> 19:20.800
It's coming!

19:22.170 --> 19:22.760
Shin!

19:24.780 --> 19:25.910
We need you!

19:25.910 --> 19:27.980
We don't need you!

19:27.980 --> 19:30.010
I wonder what would happen if I disappeared?

19:30.010 --> 19:34.590
Poor Miss Mayune, to be called family with people like that.

19:34.590 --> 19:37.190
She's not in Mawata's league.

19:37.190 --> 19:39.390
There's no way they can become sisters.

19:39.390 --> 19:41.190
It's easier to be freed from misery...

19:42.260 --> 19:43.620
We won't run!

19:44.760 --> 19:46.890
You're the only one who can do it.

19:53.540 --> 19:55.470
Damn! Fire's ineffective!

19:55.470 --> 19:56.240
All right!

19:56.240 --> 19:56.940
Mannen!

19:56.940 --> 19:58.310
I'll freeze 'em!

19:59.640 --> 20:00.510
Mannen!

20:02.880 --> 20:03.580
Kei!

20:03.580 --> 20:04.740
Their Leafe!

20:06.980 --> 20:07.480
Damn!

20:07.480 --> 20:08.280
Damn it!

20:19.860 --> 20:21.020
Go!
Hayate!

20:24.970 --> 20:26.170
Himeno...

20:26.170 --> 20:28.040
What should I do?

20:28.570 --> 20:31.580
What do I need to do to become the Prétear?

20:31.580 --> 20:33.680
Idiot! I told you to run!

20:33.680 --> 20:35.780
No! I don't want to!

20:35.780 --> 20:36.940
I won't run!

20:37.980 --> 20:38.850
You...

20:41.890 --> 20:43.010
Himeno! Your hand!

21:14.590 --> 21:15.820
This is...

21:15.820 --> 21:17.950
This is Prétear?

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
The stars shine in the night sky

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.140 --> 21:42.010
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.140 --> 21:42.010
katte na jinkusu

21:42.010 --> 21:47.990
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:42.010 --> 21:47.990
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.990 --> 21:51.960
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.990 --> 21:51.960
ashita wa egao de

21:51.960 --> 21:58.060
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.960 --> 21:58.060
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:58.060 --> 22:02.370
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:58.060 --> 22:02.370
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.370 --> 22:03.730
My Sweet Heart

22:02.370 --> 22:03.730
My Sweet Heart

22:03.730 --> 22:10.040
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.730 --> 22:10.040
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:10.040 --> 22:13.810
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:10.040 --> 22:13.810
arienai yurusenai

22:13.810 --> 22:20.820
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.810 --> 22:20.820
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.820 --> 22:29.160
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.820 --> 22:29.160
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:41.970 --> 22:43.440
Now, Himeno...

22:43.970 --> 22:45.380
Sasame?!

22:45.380 --> 22:47.280
Prét with me.

22:47.280 --> 22:47.640
But...

22:47.640 --> 22:50.550
Let Me Hear Your Heart Flutter

22:47.640 --> 22:48.380
But...

22:48.380 --> 22:50.110
I won't be beaten in the next episode either!
